{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/conventions-and-gatherings/432631-convention-lexicon-2015-vtm-larp-event-claiming-the-violet-crown","id":432631,"title":"[Convention] Lexicon 2015 - VtM LARP Event - Claiming the Violet Crown","path":["Home","Onyx Path","General","Conventions, Gatherings, and Online Play"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-03-08T09:24:23-07:00","id":432631,"title":"[Convention] Lexicon 2015 - VtM LARP Event - Claiming the Violet Crown","content":"Good morning OPP Forum!<br /> <br /> I am posting on behalf of a local troupe Vampire the Masquerade LARP in Lexington, KY. In conjunction with local gaming convention Lexicon Gaming Convention (<a href=\"http://lexicongaming.com/2015/\" target=\"_blank\">http://lexicongaming.com/2015/</a>), Bloody Athens LARP (<a href=\"http://www.lexmasqlarp.com\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.lexmasqlarp.com</a>) is hosting a 2-night special event. The LARP-side information for the event, which has links to registration and other information can be found here: <a href=\"http://www.lexmasqlarp.com/wiki/Claiming_the_Violet_Crown\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.lexmasqlarp.com/wiki/Clai...e_Violet_Crown</a><br /> <br /> If you're local and you've ever been interested in giving LARP a try, this is an ideal event to do so, as the game will be self-contained and, in true 'drive it like a rental car' fashion, full of solid pre-generated characters to choose from (but if you like your PCs enough, you'll be able to transfer them to the normal game if you wish to continue with the LARP). In addition to the LARP, there will be lots of other events going on, including a dance party and social event; registration for the con gets you into most of these without an additional fee, as well as the LARP.<br /> <br /> If you're already going to be at the convention, and want to check us out, you can swing by; no separate fee is required to participate in the LARP. If you're interested and want to participate, notate your pre-registration for the event; it will help us keep a headcount and be better able to serve our potential playerbase. Additionally, if you're going (or interested in going), and want to go all out, we encourage costuming (with accessories within the rules of the event rules).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1808-elmerg","name":"elmerg","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"539"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}